          Get the complete document requirement list: MEA Apostille steps, Embassy legalization rules, bank balance requirements (No Blocked Account!), and OEAD housing links.
        </p>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300 pt-2 text-left">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
            <span>Austrian Embassy Delhi Document List</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span>
